re implying there was an accurate image somewhere and the two images were wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12014,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12014-peraxis","user":"Peraxis","date":". 10-18-2017, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12014-peraxis","name":"Peraxis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-18T20:04:15-07:00","id":1150876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Peraxis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1150020-the-fallen-realms?p=1150860#post1150860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, I misunderstood Tessie and Dave then - I thought they were implying there was an accurate image somewhere and the two images were wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, those two images are wrong even without the weird cosmology. First one has major issues of thinking everything falls under the Supernal, while the second one has tonnes of weird things which don't match up with the games at all (though it seems to have tried to compensate the fact that some things seem to be in two places, that does end up making it look even more incorrect).<br /> <br /> The most accurate way to make a map would probably be to create set of maps, each associated with a different gameline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-th