 Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T01:54:29-07:00","id":1150931,"title":"","content":"Emanation Realms moved from being on the far side of the Abyss to being on this side, changing them from archmaster-only things to places player characters can visit.<br /> Duat is outright stated to be a Lower Depth<br /> The Arcadia question was answered with &quot;No, the Gentry's Realm is not the Supernal Realm of Time and Fate;&quot; in 1e it was ambiguous<br /> <br /> There's structural changes to the Underworld, but you'll have to wait for Geist 2e for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T02:19:03-07:00","id":1150934,"title":"","content":"I was planning on drawing separate maps for gamelines/realms like the first map.... want me to post them here when I finish them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l